    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">When constructing histograms from grouped data with unequal class intervals, use frequency density as the height of each bar. The width of each bar corresponds to the class width. This way, each bar's area represents the frequency.</p>",
